# Loaded only for `vite build --ssr --mode prerender` (see src/seo/entry-server.tsx
# and scripts/prerender.mjs), on top of .env.local — these overrides win.
#
# `createApp` requires a real Supabase client (or an authService override, which
# only tests use), so this can't blank out the Supabase pair the way a fully
# offline build might. It only has to *construct* one — `createClient` makes
# no network call on its own — so this stays safe and deterministic: nothing
# server-rendered here calls `getSession()` outside a `useEffect`, and effects
# don't run during `renderToString`. Every prerendered page renders as an
# anonymous visitor regardless of whatever real session `.env.local` implies;
# hydration reconciles the real one on the client.
#
# What *is* blanked: the OpenRouter key, since generation never runs here.
VITE_OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
